{"id":"bcfe8ad142dea69c","group":"58","path":"58/batch17/58-df-zfc-prob-markov-kernel.md","title":"ZFC Prob Markov Kernel","display":"df-zfc-prob-markov-kernel — ZFC Prob Markov Kernel","type":"definition","metadata":{"type":"definition","book":"Set Theory","book_abbrev":"58","label":"58-df-zfc-prob-markov-kernel","aliases":["58-df-zfc-prob-markov-kernel"],"display":"df-zfc-prob-markov-kernel — ZFC Prob Markov Kernel","depends_on":["[[../batch02/58-ax-zfc.md]]","[[../batch02/58-df-zfc-measure5-probability-kernel.md]]"]},"metadataError":null,"renderWarnings":[],"properties":[{"key":"type","html":"definition"},{"key":"book","html":"Set Theory"},{"key":"book_abbrev","html":"58"},{"key":"label","html":"58-df-zfc-prob-markov-kernel"},{"key":"aliases","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span>58-df-zfc-prob-markov-kernel</span></div>"},{"key":"display","html":"df-zfc-prob-markov-kernel — ZFC Prob Markov Kernel"},{"key":"depends_on","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-1\" data-note=\"a3348ed9eb6fb4e3\" href=\"?note=a3348ed9eb6fb4e3\" title=\"../batch02/58-ax-zfc.md\">../batch02/58-ax-zfc.md</a></span><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-2\" data-note=\"fb8cb910f74c1948\" href=\"?note=fb8cb910f74c1948\" title=\"../batch02/58-df-zfc-measure5-probability-kernel.md\">../batch02/58-df-zfc-measure5-probability-kernel.md</a></span></div>"}],"html":"\n<h2 id=\"Hypothesis\">[Hypothesis]</h2>\n<ul>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"X,Y,\\mathcal A,\\mathcal B,K\\in V\">\\(X,Y,\\mathcal A,\\mathcal B,K\\in V\\)</span></li>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{ZfcMeasure5ProbabilityKernel}_S\">\\(\\mathrm{ZfcMeasure5ProbabilityKernel}_S\\)</span> (probability-kernel predicate, see <a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-3\" data-note=\"fb8cb910f74c1948\" href=\"?note=fb8cb910f74c1948\" title=\"../batch02/58-df-zfc-measure5-probability-kernel.md\">../batch02/58-df-zfc-measure5-probability-kernel.md</a>)</li>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{ZfcProbMarkovKernel}_S\\subseteq V^5\">\\(\\mathrm{ZfcProbMarkovKernel}_S\\subseteq V^5\\)</span> (predicate defined here)</li>\n</ul>\n<h2 id=\"Assertion\">[Assertion]</h2>\n<figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{df\\text{-}zfc\\text{-}prob\\text{-}markov\\text{-}kernel} \\vdash \\mathrm{ZfcProbMarkovKernel}_S(K,X,\\mathcal A,Y,\\mathcal B)\\leftrightarrow \\mathrm{ZfcMeasure5ProbabilityKernel}_S(X,\\mathcal A,Y,\\mathcal B,K)\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\mathrm{df\\text{-}zfc\\text{-}prob\\text{-}markov\\text{-}kernel} \\vdash \\mathrm{ZfcProbMarkovKernel}_S(K,X,\\mathcal A,Y,\\mathcal B)\\leftrightarrow \\mathrm{ZfcMeasure5ProbabilityKernel}_S(X,\\mathcal A,Y,\\mathcal B,K)\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><h2 id=\"Remark\">[Remark]</h2>\n<ul>\n<li>This is the probability-kernel notion: each section <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"K(x)\">\\(K(x)\\)</span> is a probability measure and each evaluation <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"x\\mapsto K(x)(E)\">\\(x\\mapsto K(x)(E)\\)</span> is measurable.</li>\n</ul>\n","headings":[{"id":"Hypothesis","text":"[Hypothesis]","level":2},{"id":"Assertion","text":"[Assertion]","level":2},{"id":"Remark","text":"[Remark]","level":2}],"links":[{"target":"../batch02/58-ax-zfc.md","status":"resolved","id":"a3348ed9eb6fb4e3","anchor":"ref-1","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[../batch02/58-ax-zfc.md]]","embed":false},{"target":"../batch02/58-df-zfc-measure5-probability-kernel.md","status":"resolved","id":"fb8cb910f74c1948","anchor":"ref-2","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[../batch02/58-df-zfc-measure5-probability-kernel.md]]","embed":false},{"target":"../batch02/58-df-zfc-measure5-probability-kernel.md","status":"resolved","id":"fb8cb910f74c1948","anchor":"ref-3","targetA